{
  "_id": "tg-rejoice",
  "content": [
    {
      "text": "rejoice before the Lord, Lev. 23:40 (Deut. 12:12; 16:11). rejoice in all that ye put your hand unto, Deut. 12:7. rejoice in every good thing, Deut. 26:11. Rejoice, O ye nations, with his people, Deut. 32:43 (Rom. 15:10). I rejoice in thy salvation, 1 Sam. 2:1. let all those that put their trust in thee rejoice, Ps. 5:11. heart is glad, and my glory rejoiceth, Ps. 16:9 (Acts 2:26). Lord reigneth; let the earth rejoice, Ps. 97:1. rejoice with the wife of thy youth, Prov. 5:18. light of the eyes rejoiceth the heart, Prov. 15:30. father of the righteous shall greatly rejoice, Prov. 23:24. Rejoice not when thine enemy falleth, Prov. 24:17. righteous are in authority, the people rejoice, Prov. 29:2. my heart rejoiced in all my labour, Eccl. 2:10. Every man … to rejoice in his labour, Eccl. 5:19. poor among men shall rejoice in the Holy One, Isa. 29:19 (2 Ne. 27:30). desert shall rejoice, and blossom as the rose, Isa. 35:1. rejoiceth over the bride, so shall thy God rejoice over thee, Isa. 62:5.",
